dsh-gallery

This project is a generalized fork of dsh-meme
(https://github.com/yyh-001/dsh-meme, MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Selfloom contributors).

Inherited from upstream: the album store on node:sqlite, the whitelisted image
route, the management API, the client settings panel and input-box picker, and the
pack import/export plus market skeleton.

Changed in this repo: meme semantics removed (mood buckets, sticker prompts, the
sticker catalog semantics); images are sent as native markdown instead of DOM
decoration; per-album enable switches, SHA-256 verified pack installs, legacy
memes/ layout conversion, and optional proxy egress added.

This repo is not affiliated with, or endorsed by, the upstream authors.
